<section class="record-stage-comparison" id="capacity-source-example">
    <h2>Can tank gallons establish the approved bedrooms?</h2>
    <p>In our published Anderson case, the file recorded a 1,000-gallon tank and 360 gallons per day of design flow. The approved bedroom count was not directly stated. We did not convert those figures into an invented bedroom approval.</p>
    <p><a href="/septic-permit-process/#design-final-case">See the source-stage comparison →</a> · <a href="/how-to-read-septic-as-built/#tank-size-and-bedrooms">Read capacity labels in context →</a></p>
    <p>Use the written approval or clarification from the responsible office—not a tank-size shortcut.</p>
</section>
